      {
        order = 55,
        marker = "*",
        depth = 1,
        instruction = "After losing 8% of its HP you will get the message \"The puk seems restless.\", followed by another message at ~85% HP: \"The puk seems fearful. It seems ready to fly away.\" Once it is down to 79%, it will try to escape using the tunnel that leads to the Spinner area. It will slow down at what seems to be a random point and despawn at the ledge after the first turn if you do not manage to stop it.",
